{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-11T09:33:11.012Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-OUTLAYER-SETTLE-01","attempt":1,"title":"An OutLayer program holding a protected Ed25519 seed signs a Midge settlement that the production contract accepts","tier":"live-external","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. The OutLayer program reports a stable key; a settlement it signs (after recomputing the allocations hash itself) is accepted by the contract and pays exactly; it refuses allocations outside its bound; its signature does not cover different allocations and cannot be replayed.","limits":["This does not move the room to OutLayer: only the settlement-signing step runs there. Sealed inputs, aggregation and the escrow read stay where they are.","The program trusts the caller for the bound and the order hash, so it is a signing step, not a room.","OutLayer is a third-party platform; its workers are registered on chain once, and this run does not verify the worker's TDX quote.","The run is triggered by an account through the outlayer CLI (a request_execution call), not by a NEAR contract.","Testnet only."],"requires":["near-key","network"],"chain_prev":"46679dbb139679f2eb62cb8ab1615111243a66065361f8b5d9387f6b27d36422","chain_hash":"c26b1f61b69e7ba2833a6b59737dc50136afe6735dd8d38e5cd8ca97215731e5"}
